# Response headers for the banner files in this directory. Cloudflare reads this
# file and does not serve it (https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/headers/).
# The Worker's own handlers for the same two paths (src/routes/banner-script.ts,
# used where the files are absent) send the same values.
#
# script.js is what a page loads: an hour in the browser, so a banner fix reaches
# visitors within the hour. bundle.js is the same file for pages that cached the
# old loader: a day, as it always was.

/v1/banner/script.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *

/v1/banner/bundle.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
